  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact Cluster: Plastics in Circles</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This first project for the Impact Cluster Plastic in Circles Indonesia (PICI) focuses on support of two demonstration projects of the PICI demonstration programme.These two projects focus on three essential parts of a circular plastics value chain in Indonesia:&#x2022;	Waste collection,&#x2022;	Sorting and recycling of plastics, and&#x2022;	Development of the market of recycled plastics.In the Impact Cluster the Dutch-Indonesian consortium of the demonstration programme Plastic in Circles (PICI) aims to demonstrate innovative, yet proven technologies and best practices for improving the present state of the art in waste collection, sorting and recycling of plastics, and application of recycled plastics in valuable products. Thus, different parts of a circular plastics value chain will be demonstrated.</narrative>
  </description>
